                <pb facs="0096" n="62" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v21/pg62"/>

                <head>32. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>A meeting of Chiefs of Mission in East Asia was held at Baguio, Philippines,
                    March 2–-5. Dulles attended this meeting and addressed <pb
                        facs="0097" n="63" xml:id="pg63"/> the group. A verbatim record of
                    proceedings, entitled “Chiefs of Mission Conference”, dated March 2–5 and
                    prepared by James D. Bell, Deputy
                    Director of the Office of Philippine and Southeast Asian Affairs, who served as
                    rapporteur for the conference, is in Department of State, S/P Files: Lot 66 D
                    70, Far East.</p>
            </div>
